# Store and check out text as LF everywhere, including on Windows.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf converts Go sources to CRLF on checkout and
# `gofmt -l` then reports every file as unformatted, which would make the
# lint gate fail for a Windows contributor but pass in CI.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never transform these.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.gz  binary
*.zip binary
